  "text": "Skip to content\nOpenAI\nAlignment Research Blog\nResearch and Releases\nMisalignment Reports and Notices\nSystem Cards ↗\nMisalignment Reports and Notices\n\nWe disclose examples that show how model misalignment arises, what it looks like, and where safeguards succeed or fail.\n\nOur disclosure principles\nReports 12\nNotices 3\nReports\nCategory\nAll reports\nAgent communication\nCompaction behavior\nConcealment\nPublic uploads\nUnauthorized access\nPrompt injection\nSession continuity\nReports\nReport\n↕\n\tIncident date\n↓\n\tFirst posted\n↕\n\tLast updated\n↕\n\t\nDescription\n\n\nAn agent used DNS to reach an external chatbot\n\t9/20/26\t9/25/26\t9/25/26\t\n\n\n\nSelf-generated prompt injections in compaction summaries\n\t7/18/26\t9/16/26\t9/16/26\t\n\n\n\nSelf-replicating prompt injections exist\n\t6/27/26\t9/25/26\t9/25/26\t\n\n\n\nEncouraging deception in compaction summaries\n\t5/30/26\t9/16/26\t9/16/26\t\n\n\n\nExposing a GitHub token in a public repository\n\t5/27/26\t9/25/26\t9/25/26\t\n\n\n\nPreparing for a restart after reading Slack\n\t5/22/26\t10/2/26\t10/2/26\t\n\n\n\nCommand injecting a reference tool to copy a source file\n\t5/16/26\t10/2/26\t10/2/26\t\n\n\n\nSigning up for disposable emails and searching GitHub for leaked API keys\n\t5/15/26\t9/16/26\t9/16/26\t\n\n\n\nUnsanctioned Artifactory writes and cross-sample communication\n\t5/8/26, 5/15/26\t9/16/26\t9/16/26\t\n\n\n\nUnauthorized communication via temporary file hosting services\n\t4/14/26\t9/16/26\t9/16/26\t\n\n\n\nReaching an internal EDA host through a reference tool\n\t3/27/26\t10/2/26\t10/2/26\t\n\n\n\nUploading files to the internet in order to cite them\n\t1/24/26, 10/22/25\t9/16/26\t9/16/26\t\n\n\n\n12 of 12 reports\n\nNotices 3\nNotices\nNotice\n↕\n\tActivity date\n↕\n\tFirst posted\n↓\n\t\nDescription\n\n\nRubyGems\n\t5/2026\t9/11/26\t\n\n\n\nDSEwiki\n\t\t9/5/26\t\n\n\n\nHugging Face\n\t7/2026\t8/26/26\t\n\n\nOpenAI © 2015–2026\nTerms of use\nPrivacy policy",
